1
00:00:00,284 --> 00:00:03,414
(Bert:)Ever since I won,
people think I'm great.

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:05,920
(Sheldon:)Well, just this once,

3
00:00:05,923 --> 00:00:08,723
(Sheldon:)you can count me as people, too.

4
00:00:10,961 --> 00:00:13,591
(Bert:)You know, as a
MacArthur Grant winner,

5
00:00:13,597 --> 00:00:15,927
(Bert:)I'm allowed to nominate
someone for next year.

6
00:00:15,933 --> 00:00:18,663
(Amy:)Really?

7
00:00:18,669 --> 00:00:20,569
(Sheldon:)I didn't know that.

8
00:00:20,571 --> 00:00:21,771
(Bert:)So I was thinking,
you know,

9
00:00:21,772 --> 00:00:23,302
(Bert:)engineers don't get
a lot of respect.

10
00:00:23,307 --> 00:00:26,977
(Bert:)Is your friend Howard
working on anything cool?

11
00:00:29,546 --> 00:00:31,176
You know, I-I'm not sure.

12
00:00:31,181 --> 00:00:33,351
(Sheldon:)You know, you'd have to ask him.

13
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:34,550
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

14
00:00:42,426 --> 00:00:43,896
Aah!

15
00:00:46,063 --> 00:00:49,733
Leonard!
I hurt myself again.

16
00:00:51,401 --> 00:00:54,971
Excuse me, I-I have to
go take some pictures.

17
00:00:57,140 --> 00:01:01,020
(Amy:)I can't believe you
head-butted a water fountain.

